OL,3,AAustralia says platforms like Steam and
OL,4,ARoblox have 'significant' child safety
OL,5,Agaps
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralia's online safety regulator has
OL,8,Ffound "significant gaps" in how popular
OL,9,Fgaming platforms protect children
OL,10,Fonline.
OL,12,FIn a new report it found inconsistent
OL,13,Fapproaches in how Steam, Roblox,
OL,14,FFortnite and Minecraft implement child
OL,15,Fsafety measures as research shows nine
OL,16,Fout of 10 children aged 8 to 17 in
OL,17,FAustralia have played online games.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
