OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAustralia says platforms like Steam and
OL,4,ARoblox have 'significant' child safety
OL,5,Agaps
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Australian children have a right to
OL,8,Fplay online without being exposed to
OL,9,Fpredators, sexual extortionists,
OL,10,Fviolent extremist content or other
OL,11,Fharmful material," eSafety Commissioner
OL,12,FJulie Inman Grant said.
OL,14,FRoblox said it "prioritises the safety
OL,15,Fof our Australian community, especially
OL,16,Fthe youngest users". The other
OL,17,Fplatforms have been contacted for
OL,18,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
